## 🛠 Error Codes

| Code | Description                     |
| ---- | ------------------------------- |
| 101  | Internet connection unavailable |
| 102  | Spotify not detected            |
| 103  | PowerShell unavailable          |
| 104  | Installation failed             |
| 105  | Permission denied               |

